# Disable all line-ending and text normalisation.
# This repository ships CHECKSUMS.txt / CHECKSUMS.md covering text files as well
# as binaries. Any LF<->CRLF conversion by git would change those bytes and make
# `shasum -a 256 -c CHECKSUMS.txt` fail on checkout. Every file is stored and
# restored byte-for-byte, on every platform.
* -text
